      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LEAVE IT TO LUCY (5) is in the mix following a fifth at her most recent appearance over 2125m at Penrith. JACKS FYRE (3) ran fourth last start at this track over 1609m, beaten 11 metres. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Has the talent to take this out. DOUGS RULES (7) made it two minor placings on the trot last start when she led and battled on well but found one better at this track over 1980m. Gets a soft run on the inside of the second line but may need luck at some point. Primary contender based on those recent efforts. NIGHT TO REMEMBER (9) finished second two runs back then was brave in defeat to finish third despite breaking last start over 1980m at this track. Hard to know where she gets from this slightly awkward draw.",
